description=This mod slows down the process of reading books, magazines, and comics, making it a more immersive experience. Instead of rapidly decreasing boredom, unhappiness, and stress, it spreads these effects evenly throughout the duration of the reading. This helps create a more realistic and engaging reading experience, with gradual changes in the character's mood and mental state.
